WEBVTT

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:47.660
Xu Shanshan,

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:50.370
did you send that message in the group?

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:57.700
I will...

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.160
...show up as promised.

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:06.910
Who was that?

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:10.290
I'm going to give her another call!

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.410
The number you have dialed
cannot be reached.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.120
Cannot be reached...

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.620
Could it be...

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:33.870
She-- She's not picking up
her house phone as well,

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:35.410
should we call the police?

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:38.790
All right, I'll come over right now.

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:40.040
Don't do anything reckless,

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.450
this situation cannot be explained
clearly to ordinary police.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.250
I'm going to see Captain Xiao right now.

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.700
I have a feeling

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:49.450
that news article published online
might be the cause of the trouble.

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:56.700
Then isn't this because I...

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.830
Now is not the time to
let your thoughts run wild.

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.160
Confirming Xu Shanshan's situation
as soon as possible

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.450
is our top priority!

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:03.660
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:05.410
lock up the studio with Qiao Ling,

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:06.830
don't go anywhere.

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:07.830
Okay.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.120
I'll be right back.

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.910
Do you want us to come with you?

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.750
Looking at Cheng Xiaoshi's current state,

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:21.370
it's best to let him calm down first

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:23.200
instead of running to
the police station in a panic

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:25.000
and saying things he shouldn't.

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.580
Also,

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.620
you should hold onto his phone
for safekeeping.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.750
As of now, we can speculate
that the suspect

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.290
has quite a strong anti-social
personality disorder and aggressiveness.

00:03:58.290 --> 00:03:59.830
He also kills at random,

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.250
with no specific intentions.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:03.500
His crimes were
planned out very carefully.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.000
Many of the cases have been
misjudged as suicide,

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.950
with only one exception.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:10.120
A witness saw the victim,
Wu Lihua, getting into a car

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:13.000
with the man in the photo
before the incident.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.040
After much discussion,

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.330
this morning, our superior
department finally decided to

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:19.250
publish the only surveillance
image of the suspect

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.330
to gather clues.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:21.450
In just a few hours,

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:24.250
they had received many reports,

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:25.250
and...

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:28.120
...most of them
point to the same person.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.540
Liu Min, male, 27 years old.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.160
He had finished his education overseas,

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.830
and is currently working as
the executive director of a company.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.830
Pfft, what executive director?

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:37.000
He just succeeded his father's position.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.620
That's probably why people hate him.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.700
Without any evidence,

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:44.540
these are all just hypotheses,
we need to keep...

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.500
Captain Xiao,
there's someone here to see you.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.790
Chen Bin, where are you doing?

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:48.830
You slip away during the meeting,

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.160
and you pop up now to interrupt me,

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.160
what do you want?

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.370
Uh...

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:54.410
I got a phone call before the meeting,

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:56.120
so I went to pick someone up.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.580
Hehe...

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.870
Cheng Xiaoshi, calm down.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.540
Lu Guang has gone to make a police report.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.410
Captain Xiao seems pretty reliable,

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.200
I'm sure he'll find Shanshan.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.410
Oh right,

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.290
there should be some related news online,

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.950
there might be some clues...

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:20.910
Qiao Ling, you...

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.250
Lu Guang instructed me,

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.620
in order to prevent you from getting
more anxious by reading the rumors,

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:26.910
I will be holding onto your phone
for safekeeping.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.080
I'll go upstairs and lie down for a while,

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.910
call me when Lu Guang is back.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.540
Didn't you say you couldn't help us?

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.290
Why are you here now?

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:48.000
Can you show me the photo
of the surveillance footage again?

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.040
This has to do with
the safety of a friend of mine.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.040
What?

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.000
Your friend...?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.790
This morning, a man gave us
a strange call using her phone,

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.200
before turning the phone off.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.330
Do you suspect that

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:01.950
this has something to do
with the serial killer?

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:03.250
It's hard to say,

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.200
but the earlier we capture the murderer,

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:07.250
the earlier we can get our answer.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:10.620
Here.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:41.290
The suspect's license plate number is

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:47.540
BS30X7948.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:48.540
Captain Xiao?

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:07.330
Cheng Xiaoshi?

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:08.200
Hmm?

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:10.330
Master, are you done?

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.910
Who else has seen this photo?

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.870
This photo was posted online this morning,

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.160
everyone can see it.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.620
--Damn it!
--Hey,

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.700
where are you rushing off to?

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.410
What about your missing friend?

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:23.540
Eh?

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:27.290
Captain Xiao, what's gotten into him?

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:31.160
I don't know,
these kids are so mysterious.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.910
If it wasn't for brother Liang's
case the other day,

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:34.330
I would never have
believed in these things.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.120
Well, you know what,

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.580
believe it.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.000
Guess who is the owner of the car

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.250
with the license plate number
he rattled off just now?

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:42.790
Don't keep me guessing, just tell me!

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:44.540
It's Liu Min!

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.120
Huh?

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.660
I confiscated his phone,

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:51.080
and then he said he was
going upstairs to take a nap.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.450
Lu Guang, what is going on?

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.160
Ah! Cheng Xiaoshi!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.580
He-- He's gone!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.830
Our abilities complement each other.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.370
You can exist in the time
and space of the photos.

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:08.370
But, only under
the premise of a high-five.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.870
Eh, is there no other way?

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:13.410
Unfortunately, that's the only way.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:19.080
Then what if I high-five myself
and enter the photo...

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.790
You'll lose contact with me.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:21.750
If that happens,

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:25.160
you won't know anything about
what will happen in the photos.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.000
Huh?

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.000
How--

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.870
How did I enter the photo by myself?

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.200
As usual, you only have 12 hours.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.410
During this period,

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.200
you must keep a low profile,

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:46.870
as though you were never here.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.120
I'm only going to observe
the murderer's whereabouts

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.700
and look for clues.

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.500
I won't attract anyone's attention,

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.410
nor make any unconventional moves.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.580
Then, I'll be able to retreat unscathed.

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.750
Lu... Lu Guang?

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.790
I really can't get in touch with him.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:16.950
Damn it, where did he go?

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:22.540
Seems like this is
the surveillance camera's blind spot.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.500
I'll just wait here for him to come back,

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.950
and then...

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:28.250
Oh?

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.700
My phone...

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:32.620
Lu Guang instructed me,

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.830
in order to prevent you from getting
more anxious by reading the rumors,

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:37.080
I will be holding onto your phone
for safekeeping.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:39.500
Ah, gosh,

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:41.370
at this critical moment...

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.500
Who's there?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.080
It's the police.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.700
I have a few questions
to ask Liu Min.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.330
Mr. Liu! It's the police,

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.500
they're here to see Min Min!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.200
Why are the police here?

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.450
They haven't stopped
showing up since this morning!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.410
The screenshot of the surveillance
footage that you posted online

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.410
is ruining my son's life!

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:20.660
Mr. Liu,

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:23.500
we have received a lot of
information about your son,

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:25.200
that's why we're visiting you,

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.540
to find out the truth.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:28.160
What?

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:31.120
You really believe the comments
of those haters online?

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.410
They just hate rich people!

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:34.160
This is cyberbullying!

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.830
How could my son be involved
in these serial murders?

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:38.620
Such nonsense.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:41.000
This is the hatred of those ordinary
people toward our company,

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.500
this is such a typical revenge psychology!

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:48.000
I'm so sorry for troubling you.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.660
Hey, it's just on the way.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.200
I don't know what's going on today,

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.700
I couldn't hail a ride.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:54.700
Let's go.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:56.250
Let's not keep your parents waiting.

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:17.950
Mr. Liu,

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.540
you can't say that.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:21.250
The reason everyone has
opinions about this is because...

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:22.620
Uhh... Mr. Liu,

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.620
how about you call Liu Min out,

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:25.790
and we can have a chat?

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.120
What is there to chat about?

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.000
He has gone through enough these few days!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.830
Stop making his life harder!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.000
Go, go, go, go, go!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.750
Ms. Zhou, come out and send them off!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.000
Hey! Go, go, go, go, go!

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.200
Get lost!

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:38.410
You can ask us to leave,
but don't push us.

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:40.160
Dad, who's here?

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.370
Why aren't you leaving?

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.830
--Leave!
--You...

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:46.540
Min Min, why are you out here?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:53.540
My son was in a car accident a while ago,
he's already paralyzed!

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:56.080
How could he possibly
still go around hurting people?

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.580
If I follow this trail,

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.120
I'm bound to find some clues.

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:09.950
Oh my,

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.950
I'm so sorry, Mr. Liu,

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:14.160
I fell asleep.

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:15.370
That's okay,

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:17.160
I heard about old Mr. Zhu,

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.450
you must be upset.

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:20.000
If you're tired, rest a little.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.700
Oh, about that...

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.660
I...

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:25.830
Don't worry about it,

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.950
I was simply mentioning it.

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:30.410
So what are your plans after this?

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:32.000
I want to go home,

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.080
spend time with my parents,

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.790
and find another job.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:39.000
I used to have a longing for big cities.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.540
I would work hard,
struggle if I have to.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:44.200
But now that I think about it,

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:49.370
finding a life that suits me
is the most important thing.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.370
Huh?

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.080
Are we going the wrong way?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.200
The navigation system shows
congestion on the main road,

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:59.330
and rerouted us.

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:02.370
So how long will it take to get there?

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:07.290
I think we won't be getting there today.

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:09.000
What do you mean?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.830
Mr. Liu,

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.120
what are you doing?

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:20.950
Open the door!

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:22.120
I want to get off!

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:23.830
Get off?

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:26.500
Are you trying to run away with the money?

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:29.870
I remember that your real name was,

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.040
was something like Wu Lihua, right?

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.250
Ah,

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.580
to make you seem like the other
intellectual white-collars,

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.080
you even gave yourself an English name,

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.700
Emma.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.580
How disgusting.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.000
Emma?

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.000
Why is she here?

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:47.370
You blood-sucking parasites
from out of town,

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:49.580
no matter how glamorous
you package yourselves,

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:52.250
you won't be able to cover your stench!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:55.950
I didn't want to have anything
to do with the likes of you,

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:57.410
but...

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:58.950
Tell me!

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.370
Where is my money?

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.250
Please,

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:03.910
please let me go.

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:06.830
I... I don't know what money
you're talking about.

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:08.700
Fine.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:11.330
Then let me refresh your memory!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.830
How could this be?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.160
Why is it her?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.410
Lu Guang,

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.200
unless Lu Guang...

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.200
What are these photos?

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.160
I've understood the situation.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:23.080
I'm sorry.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:25.700
This time, there is nothing we can do.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:28.330
He had already known that
Emma was one of the victims,

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:30.950
so he didn't want me to
get involved in this case.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:34.750
It's the middle of the night. Who is it?

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:35.750
Ignore it.

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.790
--Tell me! Tell me now!
--So it's because of me...

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.370
Because I...

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.290
Tell me!

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.200
My dear daughter,

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.950
are you home yet?

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.080
I heard from your dad

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.540
that you got criticized by your supervisor

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.950
because of the call just now.

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:00.450
I'm sorry.

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:03.250
Tell me you didn't do anything stupid.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.790
It's because...

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:09.250
...I did something stupid...

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.620
You people at the bottom of the society,

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:15.950
why do you always give me trouble?

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:18.000
You live like dogs,

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.750
yet online, you slander me,

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.040
criticize me!

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.700
And after all that,
you still covet my money!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:24.660
Die,

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:25.790
die!

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.910
All of you must die!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.290
No one's picking up.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.790
We've been waiting for almost two hours,

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:43.250
where is she?

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:48.290
I hope nothing's happened to her.

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.290
Pooh, pooh, pooh,
pooh three times,

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.660
get rid of such unlucky words!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.500
Pooh, pooh, pooh, pooh...

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:13.450
Why is my kindness repaid
with such consequences?

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.450
You have to follow my commands completely,

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.250
without making any changes.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.660
You fool,

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.040
I told you.

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.950
Let the past be,

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:27.450
for we cannot change the past.

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:34.370
Let the future be,

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.870
for the future will definitely change...

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.540
...because of us.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:44.080
Lu Guang,

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.080
can you tell me,

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.370
what am I supposed to do now?

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.330
The door was locked the whole time,

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:16.160
how did he just disappear?

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:43.080
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.620
please don't do anything stupid!

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:51.000
Lu Guang,

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.410
Cheng Xiaoshi...

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:53.910
Where did he go?

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:56.580
He went...

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:03.830
He--

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.330
He...

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:07.700
He just appeared out of nowhere!

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.040
Qiao Ling?

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.000
Lu Guang,

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:13.500
why did you let Qiao Ling...

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:16.580
I've got questions for you, too!

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:17.790
Why did you do it alone?

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.910
Do you know how serious
the consequences would be?

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.700
The things you've done,
the things you'll change,

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.450
are all out of your control!

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:30.750
I know,

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.910
I know about it all,

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:34.790
so I didn't do anything...

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.250
What?

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:38.620
Then you went into the photo...

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:40.830
It's Emma.

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:44.660
The one who was killed after
entering the car with the murderer

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:46.660
was Emma...

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.830
What?

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:52.660
The CFO's assistant who gave us
the task with Quede Games?

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:54.950
Yes.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.660
There's also something else
I want to tell you.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:08.410
You've always blamed yourself
because you thought

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:10.910
you didn't notice Doudou
being abducted back then.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.120
Actually, I was responsible

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:15.080
in that case.

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.330
Let's go and take a look,

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:18.830
see how long the queue is.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.250
Cheng Xiaoshi?

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.000
It was because my sudden presence

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.250
diverted your attention away.

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.500
So you mean to say,

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.500
you can enter photos?

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:33.950
Yes.

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:37.540
My job is to enter the photos
as the executor,

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:39.700
while Lu Guang, as the observer,

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:42.000
gives me instructions on what to do.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.870
So that's why you both always hid from me.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:47.620
I always thought you were doing
some ritual with the photos!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.160
Hello, Officer Chen,

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.500
did you catch the criminal?

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.750
Did he say anything about Xu Shanshan?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.160
Uh, the license plate is definitely his,

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:56.700
but it seems that

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:58.410
he definitely isn't the perpetrator.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.950
Why?

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:03.000
At the time, didn't a victim
named Emma enter his car?

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.750
She works at Quede Games.

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.500
It's clear the two of them are connected,

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:08.910
there must be some clues you can find.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:10.540
You're pretty amazing,

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:13.000
you could even find out
about these details.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.250
Yes, but unfortunately...

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:16.120
How is it?

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:18.040
Did they catch that bastard?

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:19.410
No.

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:20.540
Lack of evidence.

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:22.540
How is that possible? I clearly...

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:25.040
According to the information
from our latest investigation,

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:27.870
Liu Min was not present at the scene
when Emma was killed.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.000
What?

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.790
That's the truth.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.750
Liu Min was in the hospital
at one o'clock that night.

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:39.450
Besides, surveillance footage
captured Emma...

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:47.540
...walking alone on an abandoned bridge.
